HB0231 Medical education funding.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Larsen, L and Nicholas and
Senator(s) Dockstader and Landen
AN ACT relating to the University of Wyoming; providing an appropriation;
authorizing expansion of the course of training and education offered in the
field of medicine as specified; and providing for an effective date.
